s that China and the  United States will properly handle the  relationship  Russia is also a member of the G20 but  President Biden will not have an  opportunity to confront Russian  President Vladimir Putin at this Summit  in Bali and that's because Putin has  decided not to attend in the face of his  faltering invasion of Ukraine Tony  faltering his word for it Nancy quarters  for us at Bali Nancy thank you
 

